abstract: >-
  Open-data computational metallurgy benchmark demonstrating deterministic,
  leakage-safe machine learning, nested cross-validation, cross-conformal
  prediction intervals, and SHA-256 data provenance for steel fault
  classification and yield-strength prediction.
